wy, mały ptak-nielot, Szeregowy. Mija 10 lat, a światu zagraża niejaki dr Oktawiusz Mackiewicz przybierający postać ośmiornicy Dave'a. Nieloty wraz z pomocą zespołu Północny Wiatr łączą siły i postanawiają powstrzymać złowrogiego doktora. Jeśli ich misja się nie powiedzie, świat będzie należał do głowonoga.","popularity":19.2723,"poster_path":"/4q1xxLMY6IjTLVo1B4vL00wSyzz.jpg","release_date":"2014-11-22","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.5,"vote_count":4534,"character":"Documentary Filmmaker (voice)","credit_id":"548c807392514122f5001f5d","order":11},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/8zK62AqZABy7eQfhf4nH2d2hUph.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":46595,"title":"Die große Ekstase des Bildschnitzers Steiner","original_language":"de","original_title":"Die große Ekstase des Bildschnitzers Steiner","overview":"","popularity":0.8162,"poster_path":"/he7rn9rVFkaNFgsawS0KEMHX5DU.jpg","release_date":"1974-01-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.214,"vote_count":70,"character":"Self","credit_id":"54a6b5f2c3a3682f21017229","order":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/jaB7VzHKoPm5U4ck0KsFJ75dqp3.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":977341,"title":"The Fire Within: A Requiem for Katia and Maurice Krafft","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Fire Within: A Requiem for Katia and Maurice Krafft","overview":"","popularity":0.9311,"poster_path":"/i1LgOPrUq40dvCVo5oWX0XNqoQa.jpg","release_date":"2024-05-09","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.7,"vote_count":32,"character":"Narrator (voice)","credit_id":"63394e10ab1bc70097f3b674","order":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":1227510,"title":"Russisches Abenteuer. Peter Fleischmann dreht \"Es ist nicht leicht, ein Gott zu sein.\"","original_language":"de","original_title":"Russisches Abenteuer. Peter Fleischmann dreht \"Es ist nicht leicht, ein Gott zu sein.\"","overview":"","popularity":0.4314,"poster_path":null,"release_date":"1990-01-22","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average"